<title>GERMANY: Bonn cuts yield on Series 121 Bobl bonds - Buba.</title>
<headline>Bonn cuts yield on Series 121 Bobl bonds - Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German government on Wednesday lowered the yield on its Series 121 five-year Bundesobligationen bonds or Bobls to 4.34 percent from 4.39 percent by raising the issue price to 101.70 from 101.50, the Bundesbank as issuing agent said.</p>
<p>The Bobl 121 is being sold on tap to non-bank investors and matures on November 20.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
